  "ingredients": [
    "1 egg",
    "0.33333334326744 cup water, or more as needed",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/R7o8QDDTOXu45HOzAftgpqR0Jzg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20881-Wonton-Wrappers-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-1ca08ff6207a45be8587733db7d0cc56.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20881/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg in a medium bowl. Mix in 1/3 cup water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JipK_ti6UhgYUA5t8oIl_9r68x4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20881-Wonton-Wrappers-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-1fd3d45baca44428a6ae96f41d2d9bb4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20881/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour and salt in a large bowl. Create a well in the center of the flour mixture and slowly pour in egg and water.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dacnjSZQtHYLqNiXXhbhVKfInhA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20881-Wonton-Wrappers-ddmfs-4x3-step-03-3c477f09cc0c4a6cb83f9f8bac57f6e2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20881/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix well. If the mixture is too dry, increase the amount of water 1 teaspoon at a time until a pliable dough has formed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u-F8ZFKRUcZak30Ib6DgIiQD9Tg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20881-Wonton-Wrappers-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-b4aa70f2fc5c48fea38bb69e2c7f9401.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20881/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead dough on a lightly floured surface until elastic.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6Yia4OWXL5ig9b5J5xd7T_Fy_VQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20881-Wonton-Wrappers-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-9d3a032da24e4321a99c9689665e1e42.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20881/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut dough into two separate balls. Cover dough balls with a damp cloth for a minimum of 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/o_ws16gh7eTq4Zl7U2EZ2isbDrY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20881-Wonton-Wrappers-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-917eb992f0744ea08d060ff25c5db6ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20881/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut each ball into four equal pieces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/azimXsMYsUuScitCfMMaovDpHZE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20881-Wonton-Wrappers-ddmfs-4x3-step-07-f01616543f7f4b18bdbfad623eadf074.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20881/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll the pieces into 10 ½ x 10 ½-inch squares. Then cut each square into nine 3 ½ x 3 ½-inch squares for a total of 72 wonton wrappers. Use in any wonton recipe.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gRTh4hNTY_zfycq6Aj4vdwHS7Kw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20881-Wonton-Wrappers-ddmfs-4x3-step-09-2fb5746bb750453d9cc861f956abf606.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20881/step_08.webp"
    }
